  "text": "Veterinary Oncology In Belen, NM | Yucca Veterinary Medical Center\n505-864-6001\nyuccavet@gmail.com\nHome\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nTestimonials\nPhoto Gallery\nServices\nAllergies\nDentistry\nDiagnostic Services\nEmergency Care\nHealth Care Services\nAll Services\nResources\nFAQs\nOnline Forms\nNew Client Form\nSurgery Consent Form\nOnline Store\nContact\nAppointment\nVeterinary Oncology in Belen, NM\nCompassionate Cancer Care for Pets in Belen, NM\nAt\nYucca Veterinary Medical Center\n, we know a cancer diagnosis can be overwhelming. That’s why our\nveterinary team\nis committed to providing compassionate oncology services for pets in Belen and Valencia County. We believe every pet deserves the chance to live comfortably and as fully as possible, and we work closely with families to explore treatment options that match their goals and their pet’s needs.\nBook Appointment\nUnderstanding Veterinary Oncology\nOur oncology services focus on diagnosing and managing cancer in dogs and cats. This includes:\nDiagnostic Testing\n– Bloodwork, radiographs, ultrasounds, and biopsies to determine the type and stage of cancer.\nTreatment Planning\n– Personalized care plans based on your pet’s diagnosis, age, and overall health.\nTherapeutic Options\n– Chemotherapy, surgery, and palliative care when appropriate.\nComfort & Support\n– Pain management and quality-of-life assessments at every stage.\nWhy Choose Yucca for Cancer Care?\nExperienced Team:\nOur veterinarians\nhave a strong focus on oncology and stay current with modern treatment protocols.\nPersonalized Care:\nEvery case is unique, and we tailor recommendations to your pet and family.\nSupportive Approach:\nWe help you understand your pet’s condition and guide you through each step with compassion.\nLocal Accessibility:\nFamilies in Valencia County don’t always have to travel to specialty hospitals for advanced cancer care.\nSchedule a Cancer Care Consultation\nIf your pet has been diagnosed with cancer or is showing concerning symptoms, we’re here to help. Call\nYucca Veterinary Medical Center\nin Belen, NM, today at\n(505) 864-6001\nor request an oncology consultation online.\nVeterinary Services in Belen\nAllergies\nDentistry\nDiagnostic Services\nEmergency Care\nHealth Care Services\nLarge Animal Care\nOncology\nOrthopedics\nPet Wellness\nSpay and Neuter\nSurgery\nTPLO\nTotal Hip Replacement\nEnd-of-Life Care\nReady To Visit?\nWe proudly serve the pets and livestock of Belen, NM, and the surrounding areas, including Valencia County, Los Lunas, Albuquerque, Socorro, and nearby communities. We look forward to seeing you and your animals soon! To book an appointment, please use the button below.\nBook Appointment\nHave a question?\nGet in touch! We are happy to help and look forward to hearing from you.\n\nLocation\n1837 Camino Del Llano\nBelen, NM 87002\n\nContact Information\nPhone:\n505-864-6001\nEmail:\nyuccavet@gmail.com\n\nHours\nMonday–Friday:\n7 AM – 5 PM\nSaturday & Sunday:\nEmergencies Only\nName\n*\nFirst\nLast\nEmail\n*\nPhone\nField Name you?\nHow can we help you?\n*\nSubmit\nFollow\n© 2026 Yucca Veterinary Medical Center |\nPowered by PetDesk\n|\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nAccessibility Statement",
